# The one authoritative attributes file for this repo. Nested .gitattributes
# files were removed deliberately: a deeper file wins over this one, and the
# two that existed ("* text=auto", in PE Essentials/ and PRPG/) covered every
# line of code in the project — they would have silently overridden the eol
# rule below for exactly the files that need it.
#
# eol=lf keeps the WORKING TREE at LF on every platform, not just the stored
# blobs. Without it a Windows checkout writes CRLF, and files nobody edited
# show up as diffs — and CI's byte-comparison of regenerated bundles becomes
# meaningless, since the bundles are generated from those same files.
* text=auto eol=lf
